---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/blog-styles.css';
---

<Layout title="Learn | Men's Post-Divorce Coaching">
    <meta slot="head"
        content="Expert guidance and actionable strategies for men rebuilding their lives after divorce. Browse our library of articles by category."
        name="description" />

    <!-- Blog Index Header -->
    <header class="blog-index-header">
        <div class="blog-index-header-content">
            <h1>Learn</h1>
            <p class="blog-index-subtitle">Actionable strategies and proven frameworks to help you rebuild your life
                after divorce.</p>
        </div>
    </header>
    <!-- Blog Index Container -->
    <div class="blog-index-container">
        <!-- Category Filter Sidebar -->
        <aside class="category-sidebar">
            <div class="category-sticky">
                <h3>Categories</h3>
                <ul class="category-list">
                    <li><a class="category-link active active" data-category="all" href="./">All Articles
                            <span class="count">(10)</span></a></li>
                    <li><a class="category-link" data-category="mindset" href="category-mindset">Mindset &amp;
                            Mental Health <span class="count">(4)</span></a></li>
                    <li><a class="category-link" data-category="strategy" href="category-strategy">Divorce Strategy
                            <span class="count">(2)</span></a></li>
                    <li><a class="category-link" data-category="relationships"
                            href="category-relationships">Relationships &amp; Dating <span
                                class="count">(2)</span></a></li>
                    <li><a class="category-link" data-category="parenting" href="category-parenting">Co-Parenting
                            <span class="count">(2)</span></a></li>
                    <li><a class="category-link" data-category="finances" href="category-finances">Financial
                            Recovery <span class="count">(1)</span></a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </aside>
        <!-- Blog Roll Grid -->
        <main class="blog-roll-main">
            <!-- Featured Article -->
            <article class="featured-article">
                <div class="featured-image">
                    <img alt="Featured Article" src="/images/blog/featured-change.png" />
                    <span class="featured-badge">Featured</span>
                </div>
                <div class="featured-content">
                    <a class="article-category" data-category="strategy" href="#">Divorce Strategy</a>
                    <h2><a href="how-divorce-changes-a-man">How Divorce Changes a Man</a></h2>
                    <p>How divorce changes a man is not just emotional — it is neurological, behavioral, physical, and
                        identity-shattering.</p>
                    <div class="article-meta-small">
                        <span class="author-small">By Alex Morgan</span>
                        <span class="date-small">Feb 2, 2026</span>
                        <span class="read-time">12 min read</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <!-- Article Grid -->
            <div class="blog-grid">
                <!-- Article Card 0 (Restored) -->
                <article class="blog-card" data-category="strategy">
                    <div class="blog-card-image">
                        <img alt="Article" src="/images/blog/rebuild-life.png" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="blog-card-content">
                        <a class="article-category" data-category="strategy" href="#">Divorce Strategy</a>
                        <h3><a href="5-strategies-rebuild-life-divorce">5 Proven Strategies to Rebuild Your Life
                                After Divorce</a></h3>
                        <p>Stop the mental replay loop and start your comeback with these actionable steps.</p>
                        <div class="article-meta-small">
                            <span class="author-small">By Alex Morgan</span>
                            <span class="date-small">Feb 2, 2026</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <!-- Article Card 1 -->
                <article class="blog-card" data-category="mindset">
                    <div class="blog-card-image">
                        <img alt="Article" src="/images/blog/stop-overthinking.png" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="blog-card-content">
                        <a class="article-category" data-category="mindset" href="#">Mindset &amp; Mental Health</a>
                        <h3><a href="stop-overthinking-men">How to Stop Overthinking After Divorce as a Man</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p>Break the mental replay loop with these science-backed strategies that actually work.</p>
                        <div class="article-meta-small">
                            <span class="author-small">By Alex Morgan</span>
                            <span class="date-small">Jan 28, 2026</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <!-- Article Card 2 -->
                <article class="blog-card" data-category="parenting">
                    <div class="blog-card-image">
                        <img alt="Article" src="/images/blog/co-parenting.png" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="blog-card-content">
                        <a class="article-category" data-category="parenting" href="#">Co-Parenting</a>
                        <h3><a href="co-parenting-guide-men">The Complete Guide to Co-Parenting for Divorced
                                Men</a></h3>
                        <p>Navigate co-parenting with confidence and clarity using this comprehensive framework.</p>
                        <div class="article-meta-small">
                            <span class="author-small">By Alex Morgan</span>
                            <span class="date-small">Jan 25, 2026</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <!-- Article Card 3 -->
                <article class="blog-card" data-category="relationships">
                    <div class="blog-card-image">
                        <img alt="Article" src="/images/blog/social-circle.png" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="blog-card-content">
                        <a class="article-category" data-category="relationships" href="#">Relationships &amp;
                            Dating</a>
                        <h3><a href="new-social-circle-men">Building a New Social Circle After Divorce for Men</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p>Practical steps to rebuild your network and find your tribe in this new chapter.</p>
                        <div class="article-meta-small">
                            <span class="author-small">By Alex Morgan</span>
                            <span class="date-small">Jan 22, 2026</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <!-- Article Card 4 -->
                <article class="blog-card" data-category="mindset">
                    <div class="blog-card-image">
                        <img alt="Article" src="/images/blog/victim-mentality.png" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="blog-card-content">
                        <a class="article-category" data-category="mindset" href="#">Mindset &amp; Mental Health</a>
                        <h3><a href="victim-mentality-men">Breaking Free from Victim Mentality for Divorced Men</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p>Essential steps to stabilize your finances and build a solid foundation post-divorce.</p>
                        <div class="article-meta-small">
                            <span class="author-small">By Alex Morgan</span>
                            <span class="date-small">Jan 20, 2026</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <!-- Article Card 5 -->
                <article class="blog-card" data-category="mindset">
                    <div class="blog-card-image">
                        <img alt="Article" src="/images/blog/managing-anger.png" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="blog-card-content">
                        <a class="article-category" data-category="mindset" href="#">Mindset &amp; Mental Health</a>
                        <h3><a href="managing-anger-men">Managing Anger and Resentment for Divorced Men</a></h3>
                        <p>Practical techniques to process difficult emotions and move forward.</p>
                        <div class="article-meta-small">
                            <span class="author-small">By Alex Morgan</span>
                            <span class="date-small">Jan 18, 2026</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <!-- Article Card 7 -->
                <article class="blog-card" data-category="parenting">
                    <div class="blog-card-image">
                        <img alt="Article" src="/images/blog/setting-boundaries.png" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="blog-card-content">
                        <a class="article-category" data-category="parenting" href="#">Co-Parenting</a>
                        <h3><a href="boundaries-ex-wife">Setting Boundaries with Your Ex-Wife</a></h3>
                        <p>How to establish and maintain healthy boundaries for successful co-parenting.</p>
                        <div class="article-meta-small">
                            <span class="author-small">By Alex Morgan</span>
                            <span class="date-small">Jan 12, 2026</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <!-- Article Card 8 -->
                <article class="blog-card" data-category="relationships">
                    <div class="blog-card-image">
                        <img alt="Article" src="/images/blog/start-dating.png" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="blog-card-content">
                        <a class="article-category" data-category="relationships" href="#">Relationships &amp;
                            Dating</a>
                        <h3><a href="when-start-dating">When Should Men Start Dating After Divorce</a></h3>
                        <p>Signs you're ready to date again and how to approach it with confidence.</p>
                        <div class="article-meta-small">
                            <span class="author-small">By Alex Morgan</span>
                            <span class="date-small">Jan 10, 2026</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
            <!-- Load More Button -->
            <div class="load-more-container">
                <button class="load-more-btn">Load More Articles</button>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>
</Layout>
